; LSFVG (Liquidity Sweep + Fair Value Gap) — Apr 25, 3% risk
; Next WFO: May 9 2026
;
; Sanity ET (Feb 14 -> Apr 25, $10k): NP=$+1,921 (+19.2% ROI) / DD 5.0% /
;   32 trades / WR 56.2% / PF 1.81 / NP/DD 384
;
; Selected over WFO grid winner (Lk=8 RR=3.0 HTP=0.0) because:
;   - 3/3 OOS windows profitable vs 2/3 (WFO winner failed Apr 11-25)
;   - 5.0% DD vs 11.5% — half the risk
;   - Risk-adjusted ROI: 3.84 vs 2.65 (ROI/DD%)
;   - 32 trades vs 18 — better compounding consistency
;   - WFO winner's higher NP came entirely from one outlier window (W2)
;
; Strategy:
;   On every M15 close, look back lookback_bars to find liquidity pool
;   high/low. If bar 1-2 swept the pool AND bar 1 closed back inside AND
;   a 3-bar bearish/bullish FVG formed (low[3] > high[1] for bearish),
;   place a SellLimit/BuyLimit at the FVG edge. SL beyond sweep wick + buf,
;   TP at SL_dist × RR. Half-TP split (50/50) at 1R+2R.
;
